WEBVTT

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:10.350
Looks like the Bloody Cross and
all of Giou's Zweilts are here.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.820
What shall we do, Reiga-dono?

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.110
Our enemy has fortuitously come to see us.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.980
Surely, you do not intend to
waste this opportunity.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.620
<i>Lufen.</i>

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.410
What?

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.400
Cadenza, we're leaving.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.380
What?

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:44.390
I just used my power to free you
from your chains of servitude.

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.460
Under these conditions,

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:51.350
it would be unwise to turn Zess
and the Giou Clan against me.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.940
Obey my command, Cadenza.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:03.110
I will retreat today. But next time...

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.450
I will kill you!

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:14.080
Kanata-san.

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:19.670
Tell the leader of the Giou Clan

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:24.250
that if he wants to end this battle,
he himself will have to fight.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.680
Wait, Kanata-san!

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.050
Never utter that name again.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:31.580
But...

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:32.340
Enough!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.230
My name is Giou Reiga.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.290
Don't forget that, Giou Yuki.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:50.950
Kanata-san...

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.090
Yuki. Yuki!

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:05.280
Yuki! Hey, Yuki!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:11.760
Only I know your pain...

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.270
Your uncertainty...

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.100
Your loneliness...

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:22.450
If only we could be together forever.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.740
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.960
I will not betray you!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.890
Yuki still won't wake up?

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:27.660
No.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.600
It's already been more than half a day.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:36.740
It's our fault Yuki always ends up like this.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:42.650
We get injured in battle, and Yuki heals us.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.890
The more Yuki heals us,

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.490
the more he hurts, until he collapses.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.260
It happens over and over.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:53.620
That's exactly why we have
to make every effort,

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:57.020
when fighting, to sustain as
few injuries as possible.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:57.920
Yeah.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:01.470
But that Cadenza...

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:05.430
General Classes are always that powerful.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:08.060
They're leagues above the other Opast.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.930
He's still no match for me.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:15.530
Kuroto, don't go saying
he's your enemy alone!

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:21.360
Hotsuma's saying we should fight together.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.360
I'm sorry he's not great
at expressing himself.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.060
Hey!

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.510
In any case...

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:30.790
Unlike the Duras, we work as a unit.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.710
Isn't that right?

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:38.390
And we have Luka.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.970
You really are stubborn.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.710
Why don't you come inside, Luka-kun?

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.210
If you're not here when Yuki-kun wakes up,

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.890
it will only cause trouble.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:58.190
He'll run out again, saying
he has to look for you.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.320
Besides, everyone thinks of you as an ally.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.820
Stay with Yuki-kun, for his sake.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:13.910
Luka-sama.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.290
I have been waiting for you.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:20.820
Aya-chan came here as well,
since it's almost time.

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:23.840
Allow me to show you to Yuki-san's room.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:28.890
To the Final Battle...

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:42.610
Master, Yuki's sleeping.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:44.230
I'm worried about Yuki.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.250
Doctor, how is Yuki-kun doing?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.470
The damage was severe.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:58.820
He made a Halo Wall,
despite being unable to completely

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:01.330
control his power.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.650
He must have done it unconsciously.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.590
In order to protect everyone...

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.830
But if it happens again...

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.990
He looks so peaceful when he sleeps,

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:20.480
but he's full of pain and suffering inside.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.300
How is Takashiro?

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:27.110
He's still cooped up in his room,
making preparations

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.160
for the end of this battle.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.620
Not even medicine can help him.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.590
Take care of Yuki for me.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.990
I'm going to check on Takashiro.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:53.770
Damn it!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.710
Calm down.

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.190
You're still not a full necromancer yet.

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:04.770
That may be, but I want to fight
alongside everyone.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.860
There has to be something I can do-

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.050
There is one thing.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.320
Become even stronger.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:14.450
Become strong enough that you
can protect your own life first.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.370
That's all you can do right now.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.550
But we need all the combatants we can get.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:25.840
That's true, but we still can't
send you into battle.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:30.300
It's painful enough to send the Zweilts.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.010
Tsubaki-san...

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:35.300
I can't tell them not to go.

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.690
So I hope for their safe return.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:41.820
All I can do is pray for them.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.780
I'm sorry, I...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:49.780
I'm counting on you, necromancer-to-be.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.370
<i>It's so quiet.</i>

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:01.080
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:07.190
<i>It's like we're the only ones
left in the world.</i>

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.030
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:12.710
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.510
<i>Why do you look so sad?</i>

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:25.230
<i>Because all I can think of is you.</i>

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.630
<i>That's all I need.</i>

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:31.780
<i>Those words give me enough
to keep living.</i>

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.960
<i>Even if an unimaginable
amount of time passes,</i>

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.690
<i>and no matter how you look,</i>

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.790
<i>I will find your soul.</i>

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:45.710
<i>You are my reason for life.</i>

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:56.590
Yuki.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:58.310
Yuki!

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.430
Luka.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:02.760
Sodom.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:05.760
Yuki woke up! Yuki woke up!

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:08.610
Are you all right?

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:12.250
Yeah, sorry to worry you, Luka.

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:15.160
I see you came inside for me.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.050
Yes.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.550
Hooray, Yuki! Hooray, master!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:22.910
Sorry to make you worry, Sodom.

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:25.500
Where is everyone?

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:28.710
Don't worry. They're all fine.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.170
Good.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.420
I realized something.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.870
The Kanata-san inside of me is real,

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.980
but there is no doubt Reiga
resides within him.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:52.290
I need to end this, before
anyone else gets hurt.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.240
You have my everything.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:04.870
I see. Takashiro's condition hasn't changed.

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:08.450
Yes. He doesn't wish anyone
to see him in pain,

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:09.540
so he stays by himself.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:14.790
If something happens, I will
contact you immediately.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.640
Yeah, please do.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.920
We should get going.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:26.370
There's no need for you to suffer.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.060
That's unnecessary for you to say.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:34.320
My suffering is nothing, as
compared to your pain.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.540
You have served me very well.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.320
Takashiro-sama?

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.300
Don't worry.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.870
My death won't be for nothing.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.620
I promise.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.390
Takashiro-sama.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.730
<i>Kanata-san, the sakura
are blooming.</i>

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.960
<i>They're beautiful.</i>

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:12.810
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:18.050
Yuki saved me from my loneliness.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:21.610
Yuki convinced me to believe in others.

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:25.720
If everyone were like you...

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.870
My hatred or my memories.

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.510
Which will consume me?

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.510
Is it true?

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:48.470
Did Reiga-sama really protect God's Light?

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:51.140
I'd like to believe it was merely a joke,

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:54.100
but it means he isn't fully committed.

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:57.530
I can't stand it.

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.480
Let's kill all of them ourselves!

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:02.980
Did you hear that?

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.280
What did you do to him?

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.580
I only gave him a bit of some special wine.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.340
Elegy-sama's blood tasted amazing.

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:15.900
My entire body is on fire.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:19.090
I feel like I could kill everyone!

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.920
How tasteless.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:25.090
Don't say that. Would you like some?

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:27.970
I have no need for such things.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.540
I see.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.100
You seem quite interested in the
Zweilt of the Black Sword.

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:38.420
Destroying the bonds of those
who so highly value them

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.820
is true pleasure.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.230
And you don't believe that to be tasteless?

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:47.190
So what's it going to be?

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.830
Are we killing them? Are
we not killing them?

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:56.420
Let us see where our master's
true intentions lie.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.210
Yuki-chan!

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:03.630
I'm so glad you're awake.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:04.970
We were worried about you, Yuki.

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:09.360
Sorry for making all of you worry.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.550
Are you okay?

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:11.510
Yes.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.140
You shouldn't be so reckless.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:21.610
I know. But I want to do everything
I can to end this battle.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.300
Yuki-chan.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.360
All I can do is heal your wounds.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:31.870
But I still want to fight alongside everyone!

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:37.580
You idiot, of course you will!

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.080
Yes.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.820
O-Once all of this is over,

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:47.100
I'll bake a delicious cake, and
we can eat it together.

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:47.980
Okay?

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:51.400
Don't make me eat your cake.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:53.170
What did you say?

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:54.660
We have Toma-san.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.500
You, too, Shusei?

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.270
And I was willing to go to the
trouble of baking for you!

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:03.400
There are some things you just can't do.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:06.400
Hey! What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.180
Oh, shut up, already!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.480
You shut up!

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:10.510
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.680
No fighting!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.570
You're an idiot! Hotsuma, you're an idiot!

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.900
Let's try to get along!

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:25.130
Let's end this, so we can all go
home to the Twilight Mansion.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:28.630
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:29.920
Yeah.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.630
Luka?

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:44.430
Takashiro-sama!

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.240
Don't worry about me...

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.220
See to the rest of them.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:49.150
Yes, sir!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.080
Come on out, humans.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.070
Let's go, Shusei!

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:00.990
Right.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:08.450
Luka, take care of Yuki-chan!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.970
I'm fine.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.320
No.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.510
Leave this one to us.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.980
We'll be back!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.960
Don't worry. Should it become
necessary, I will go.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:22.560
Okay.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:25.270
Tsubaki-san!

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.530
Calm down.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.400
I'm sure the Zweilts are on their way.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.140
Everyone...

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.460
You're alive?

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:51.170
I'm not alone.

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:10.610
Who will entertain me today?

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:12.320
Cadenza!

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.460
I'm going!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.470
I'll go.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.180
But...

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.520
No. Stay here.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:41.270
Sodom, look after Yuki.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.510
I'll protect Yuki!

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:24.910
Senshiro!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.230
Is that all?

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.070
Luka.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.610
You should have stayed home, you brats!

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:08.930
Everyone...

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:12.930
Sodom...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.280
Please let me go.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.140
I must go.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:37.470
You finally decided to show
yourself, God's Light.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:43.720
Yuki...

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:48.160
<i>But if it happens again...</i>

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.190
I can't let you do that!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.620
I'll keep him busy.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.330
You two, look after Yuki!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:15.130
If he uses his power now,
Yuki won't survive.

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:17.610
Stop him before it comes to that.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.070
Is that you, Reiga?

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.930
My, my.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:37.940
And it was just getting good.
My, my.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:40.440
And it was just getting good.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:44.410
Is this what you wanted, Reiga-dono?

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:55.460
Don't move.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:59.380
If you move, God's Light
will die, here and now.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.840
Kanata-san.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.470
We're leaving.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:10.030
That's that.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.910
What can you do?

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:30.610
Yuki!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.160
Yuki-chan...

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:03.950
Yuki.

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:36.870
Senshiro.

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:38.140
What is it, Kuroto?

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:40.210
Don't you draw anymore?

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:42.210
I draw you every night,
while you're sleeping.

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:44.410
Why, you...

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:45.840
I'm just kidding!

00:23:46.010 --> 00:25:09.950
Traitors' Battle
